0 -16 Td
(Q5: How does the system prevent LLM hallucinations in the Machine Copilot?) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(A: The Copilot does not invent data. All telemetry \(current readings, MSE, 3-sigma limits, RUL\)) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(is calculated deterministically by our mathematical models and injected as structured JSON context) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(into the server-side Gemini prompt. The model acts strictly as an analytical explainability layer.) Tj
/F2 10 Tf
0 -16 Td
(Q6: How do you handle transient sensor spikes \(noise vs true failure onset\)?) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(A: Individual sensor readings are subject to electrical EMI noise. Our Autoencoder reconstruction) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(evaluates cross-sensor correlation across all 6 channels simultaneously. A single noisy pin will) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(not breach the statistical 3-sigma multi-channel barrier without correlated shifts in related channels.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
0 -20 Td
(CATEGORY 3: BUSINESS VALUE & COMMERCIAL ROI) Tj
/F2 10 Tf
0 -16 Td
(Q7: How do you justify the $168,000 cost avoidance figure to a CFO?) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(A: An unscheduled Aircraft on Ground \(AOG\) or transformer flashover averages $180,000 to $450,000) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(in emergency logistics, passenger rerouting, collateral core destruction, and grid fines. A scheduled) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(overnight line replacement costs $12,000 to $22,000. Preventing just one catastrophic failure pays) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(for our entire enterprise monitoring deployment for over 3 years \(+1,400% ROI\).) Tj
/F2 10 Tf
0 -16 Td
(Q8: How does the platform scale from aviation to other machines like transformers or pumps?) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(A: Our two-stage architecture is domain-agnostic. The Autoencoder does not know what a turbine is;) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(it learns normal correlation manifolds. Whether inputs are temperatures, dissolved hydrogen gas,) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
0 -13 Td
(or pump flow rates, the mathematical pipeline operates identically.) Tj
